# ART-ALL08 -- W3-FIX-A art acceptance. ALL08 (URBAN, St Louis): the Gateway Arch (CASTL04, isogen.mix).
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL08U.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 400 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 30
cheat reveal
cheat art_dump
assert art.missing == 0
cheat view_building CASTL04
wait 2
shot arch
